{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the corridors of Obscurinth, a vast labyrinth named after its guardian, which has been struck by a mysterious curse that has also ravaged the area. You will have to venture into the depths of eerie passageways and find your way to the exit. Don't think your quest will be easy. Obscurinth is one of the most complicated labyrinths in the world, and you'll have a hard time escaping. That's why it's important to reach each magic brazier (save point) before resting. You'll encounter various deadly traps, bonuses to acquire, mysterious characters who will help you get through, and unusual finds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953850/extras/449fbd61711955fef1f5ea6e879dc9e7.avif?t=1761196362\" width=748 height=896 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accomplish feats by spending time visiting the corridors and score as many points as possible to climb the rankings of the best players. Each time you successfully complete the maze, you can start again with an additional point multiplier bonus and keep your legacy, which includes your unused inventory, acquired keys, and SPEED and POWER progress bars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be no enemies to fight, but traps can take away all your life. You will recover all your health at each save point. You will learn how to use each element of the maze as you discover them. The more you wander through the corridors and complete the course, the easier the adventure will seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joy is a mysterious adventurer that you will control from a top-down view to stay in the traditional spirit of maze board games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953850/extras/b785ff115f95ce5aa605a932bc187b3c.avif?t=1761196362\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953850?t=1761196362","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953850?t=1761196362","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953850/0b461816686b958c64b2c00f216b2892fcda25f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761196362","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953850/0b461816686b958c64b2c00f216b2892fcda25f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761196362","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the corridors of Obscurinth, a vast labyrinth named after its guardian, which has been struck by a mysterious curse that has also ravaged the area. You will have to venture into the depths of eerie passageways and find your way to the exit. Don't think your quest will be easy. Obscurinth is one of the most complicated labyrinths in the world, and you'll have a hard time escaping. That's why it's important to reach each magic brazier (save point) before resting. You'll encounter various deadly traps, bonuses to acquire, mysterious characters who will help you get through, and unusual finds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953850/